><tr class="pp-total-emph"><th>Total</th><td class="num">₱520,000.00</td></tr></tbody></table><p class="pp-words"><span class="pp-label-inline">Amount in words: </span>Five hundred twenty thousand pesos only</p><section class="pp-terms-block" aria-label="Terms and conditions"><div class="pp-label">TERMS AND CONDITIONS</div><div class="pp-terms-list"><div class="pp-terms-item">1. This quotation is valid for 15 days unless the quote states otherwise. Prices are in PHP. HACIEN is NON-VAT registered. The delivery fee is quoted separately. Prices of imported items may change if the exchange rate moves before we order. If they do, we will send a revised quotation first.</div><div class="pp-terms-item">2. Payment: 50% down payment when you order, 50% on delivery. Software and special orders: 100% before we order. 30-day terms apply only to approved corporate and government accounts. Pay by bank transfer, check or cash, only to the account printed on this document.</div><div class="pp-terms-item">3. Lead times are estimates, not fixed deadlines, and are subject to supplier stock. Every item is ordered for you, so an order can&#x27;t be cancelled once we place the supplier order, and we don&#x27;t accept change-of-mind returns. Defective, damaged or wrong items are repaired, replaced or refunded as the law requires.</div><div class="pp-terms-item">4. On delivery, note any missing boxes or visible damage on the Delivery Receipt. Report visible damage within 24 hours, and missing or wrong contents within 3 days, to sales@haciensolutions.com or Viber, with photos. Your legal rights for hidden defects are not affected.</div><div class="pp-terms-item">5. Unless specific warranty notes on this quotation state otherwise, warranty is the manufacturer&#x27;s or distributor&#x27;s, and we handle the claim for you. If a hardware item is dead on arrival, report it within 7 days and return shipping is free.</div><div class="pp-terms-item">6. If you withhold tax, tell us before paying and give us a signed BIR Form 2307 upon payment. Without it, the withheld amount stays unpaid.</div><div class="pp-terms-item">7. HACIEN keeps ownership of the goods until they are fully paid. Accounts unpaid past their due date are charged 24% interest a year, plus 25% attorney&#x27;s fees if we must go to court. Any case is filed in the proper courts of Pasig City. Full Terms of Sale apply: haciensolutions.com/terms-of-sale.</div></div></section><section class="pp-pay" aria-label="Payment instructions"><div class="pp-label">Bank / e-wallet details</div><ul><li>Bank: Sample Bank · HACIEN Sample · ****1234</li></ul></section><section class="pp-signatories" aria-label="Signatures"><div class="pp-signatory"><div class="pp-sign-role">Prepared by</div><div class="pp-sign-line pp-sign-line--blank" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="pp-sign-name">Jerwin</div><div class="pp-sign-position"> </div></div><div class="pp-signatory"><div class="pp-sign-role">Conforme</div><div class="pp-sign-line" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="pp-sign-name"> </div><div class="pp-sign-name-hint">Printed name</div><div class="pp-sign-date">Date</div></div></section></div><footer class="pp-foot"><div class="pp-foot-left"><span class="pp-thank-you">Thank you for your business</span><div class="pp-version-line pp-faint">Terms of Sale v1.1 · Warranty v1.1 · Privacy v2.3 · haciensolutions.com/policies</div><div class="pp-tax-line">This is a quotation, not an invoice.</div></div><div class="pp-page-num" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="pp-qr-spacer" aria-hidden="true"></div></footer></td></tr></tbody></table></article>"
`;

